<title>USA: Harrah's Entertainment Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Harrah's Entertainment Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.30</p>
<p> Net			 17,111		   31,410</p>
<p> Revs		     374,099		  382,883</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 102,156		  103,379</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Harrah's Entertainment Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating net income was $0.22 per share, excluding costs of opening new St. Louis complex.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.16 per share.</p>
</text>
